```go
func (s *Store) Decide(org string, subject Subject, resource Resource, action string) Decision {
	return s.evaluate(org, 0, subject, resource, action)
}
```

Hmm, version 0 means "current". Let me use a special: `Review` takes explicit version; Decide resolves current.

```go
func (s *Store) Decide(org string, subject Subject, resource Resource, action string) Decision {
	o := s.org(org)
	o.mu.RLock()
	version := o.current
	o.mu.RUnlock()
	return s.evaluate(org, version, subject, resource, action)
